    "rationale": "Correct: $f(x) = \\frac{1}{b - a} = \\frac{1}{7 - 2}$, so the total area is $5 \\times \\frac{1}{5} = 1$."
   },
   {
    "key": "B",
    "content": "$\\frac{1}{7}$",
    "rationale": "This uses the upper limit alone; the width of the interval is 7 − 2 = 5."
   },
   {
    "key": "C",
    "content": "$\\frac{1}{9}$",
    "rationale": "This divides by a + b; the height is one over the width b − a."
   },
   {
